{"id":"9f91888dacef2bdf","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-confluence.md","title":"Confluence","display":"df-confluence — Confluence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-confluence","aliases":["72-df-confluence"],"display":"df-confluence — Confluence","depends_on":["[[72-df-normalization-proof]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, ch.4 §4.1 print22–23","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_2026_10_22":"补出合流保证可达正规形唯一，而不额外假设终止"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-confluence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-confluence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-confluence — Confluence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db757aa1a8cf57f3\" href=\"?note=db757aa1a8cf57f3\" title=\"72-df-normalization-proof\">72-df-normalization-proof</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, ch.4 §4.1 print22–23"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"补出合流保证可达正规形唯一，而不额外假设终止"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X^2\">\\(R\\subseteq X^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^*\">\\(R^*\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"db757aa1a8cf57f3\" href=\"?note=db757aa1a8cf57f3\" title=\"72-df-normalization-proof\">72-df-normalization-proof</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Join}_R(y,z)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists w\\in X\\ (\\langle y,w\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\langle z,w\\rangle\\in R^*),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Conf}(X,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R^*)\\to\\operatorname{Join}_R(y,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{LocalConf}(X,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\operatorname{Join}_R(y,z)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Join}_R(y,z)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists w\\in X\\ (\\langle y,w\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\langle z,w\\rangle\\in R^*),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Conf}(X,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R^*)\\to\\operatorname{Join}_R(y,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{LocalConf}(X,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\operatorname{Join}_R(y,z)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\quad\n\\operatorname{Conf}(X,R)\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R^*\n\\land\\operatorname{Normal}_R(y)\\land\\operatorname{Normal}_R(z)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ y=z.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\quad\n\\operatorname{Conf}(X,R)\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R^*\n\\land\\operatorname{Normal}_R(y)\\land\\operatorname{Normal}_R(z)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ y=z.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>局部合流只限制一步分叉，合流允许两侧任意有限步。</p>\n<p>若两个正规形从同一点可达，合流给共同后继w。正规形没有一步后继，所以从它出发的有限归约只能是零步；于是y=w=z。该唯一性不保证正规形存在，也不需要全系统强正规化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-normalization-proof","status":"resolved","id":"db757aa1a8cf57f3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-normalization-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-normalization-proof","status":"resolved","id":"db757aa1a8cf57f3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X$ 是集合，$R\\subseteq X^2$，$R^*$ 如 [[72-df-normalization-proof]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X^2","display":false},{"tex":"R^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Join}_R(y,z)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists w\\in X\\ (\\langle y,w\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\langle z,w\\rangle\\in R^*),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Conf}(X,R)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R^*)\\to\\operatorname{Join}_R(y,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{LocalConf}(X,R)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\ ((\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R)\\to\\operatorname{Join}_R(y,z)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\quad\n\\operatorname{Conf}(X,R)\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R^*\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in R^*\n\\land\\operatorname{Normal}_R(y)\\land\\operatorname{Normal}_R(z)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ y=z.","display":true}],"bytes":1900,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-394","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-confluence|df-confluence — Confluence]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-392","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-confluence — Confluence](72-df-confluence.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-428","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-confluence|df-confluence — Confluence]]"},{"id":"fe827319be301398","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X$ 是集合，$R\\subseteq X^2$。$\\operatorname{SN}(X,R)$、$\\operatorname{Conf}(X,R)$、$\\operatorname{LocalConf}(X,R)$ 分别使用 [[72-df-strong-normalization]] 与 [[72-df-confluence]] 的定义。"},{"id":"d1bdc5d626d71488","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-confluence]]"}],"outgoing":["db757aa1a8cf57f3"]}